// purpose: Count the number of Azure Resources for each subscription.
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Azure%20Resource%20Graph/Functions/AzureResourceCount.md
